{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地頂流肖戰出道10周年，昨晚（23日）假南京舉行首次個人巡迴演唱會《出口．我們》首場，網上一票難求，現場座無虛席，台下全是應援色紅海一片，畫面震撼。</p><p>會場內外鋪滿大片紅色鮮花應援，肖戰代言的多個品牌、劇組等均送上花牌道賀。</p><p>而肖戰主演的新劇《</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T02:15:59.549918+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:10:05.894403+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T02:10:05.894403+00:00","content_hash":"200afbd7ada2a5185f3003e5422899f7da3648a4982eba4df73c8ce49f9f8627","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}